WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:13,320
Mom, did the baby protect everyone?

2
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,820
Protected, you saved many people

3
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:20,680
Lie down first, you just used one door empty, you won't be injured if you don't

4
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:25,060
Won't come in again

5
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:28,060
Chief, I have never fully explained my intention.

6
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:31,020
it's called loyalty

7
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:33,020
I can assign an allegiance to someone

8
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,020
See how loyal others are to it

9
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:37,020
As long as the other party doesn’t reject it in their heart

10
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,020
You can also actively accept the loyalty status

11
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,020
What will happen if you accept it?

12
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,020
The higher the loyalty, the more priority will be given to obeying the object of allegiance.

13
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,020
reach 100%

14
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:46,020
Even if the order conflicts with the original hospital, it is difficult to refuse
